:"Mustard","SESAME":"Sesame","MILK":"Milk","ALMOND":"Almond","BRAZILNUT":"Brazil Nut","CASHEW":"Cashew","HAZELNUT":"Hazelnut","MACADAMIA":"Macadamia","PECAN":"Pecan","PISTACHIO":"Pistachio","WALNUT":"Walnut","HEARTNUT":"Heartnut/Japanese walnut","CALIFORNIA_WALNUT":"California walnut","BLACK_WALNUT":"Black walnut","QUEENSLAND_NUT":"Queensland nut","PINENUT":"Pine Nut","SOY":"Soy","FISH":"Fish","CRUSTACEANS":"Crustaceans","MOLLUSCS":"Molluscs","CELERY":"Celery","SULPHITES":"Sulphur Dioxide (Sulphites)","RYE":"Rye","BARLEY":"Barley","OATS":"Oats","SPELT":"Spelt","KAMUT":"Kamut","LUPIN":"Lupin"},"title.rewards-and-savings":"Rewards & Savings","editor-routes.page-not-found":"Page not found","editable-map.location-selector-helper":"Select which location to show on the map","checkout-page.title":"checkout page","confirmation-page.title":"confirmation page","ecomm-checkout-page.title":"checkout page","ecomm-confirmation-page.title":"confirmation page","ecomm-page.online-store":"Online Store","ecomm-page.menu":"menu","ecomm-page.ordering-unavailable":"Online ordering is currently unavailable. Please contact the restaurant to place an order.","checkout-error-modal.out-of-stock":"Sorry, one of the items in your order is out of stock. It has been removed from your order.","checkout-error-modal.order-time-unavailable":"Sorry, your order can no longer be completed at this time. Please pick a new order time.","checkout-error-modal.promo-code-redeemed":"You have already redeemed this one-time promotion. Please remove the promo code and try again.","checkout-error-modal.temporary-hold-notice":"You may see a temporary hold on your card, but it will be released in 24-48 hours and your card account will not be charged.","checkout-error-modal.credit-card-declined":"Your credit card was declined. You have not been charged, but may notice a temporary authorization on your statement. Please review card information and try again.","checkout-error-modal.online-ordering-disabled":"Sorry, we 